<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Tap strafe</Major>
    <Description>Put the macro on spacebar, in game put the 2nd option to "move foraward" to 'i" now when you want to tap strafe just press space bar and it will tap strafe in the direction you point your mouse.</Description>
